<p>Our <b>Security Command Center</b> has detected that a service account key associated with your project <b>vigilyx-prod</b> (Project ID: <code>vigilyx-prod-331006</code>) has been exposed in a public code repository.</p>

<h3 style="color:#4285f4;border-bottom:2px solid #4285f4;padding-bottom:4px">Alert Details</h3>
